        {
            "+content": "Straight black hair with a blonde streak, chunky earrings, and striking red lipstick — Yuki starts college with a strong sense of style that makes heads turn. But a week passes, and she hasn't made a single friend. All of her classmates are too intimidated to even approach her. Yuki's luck might start to change, though, when she learns her favorite fashion influencer goes to her school and has a chance run-in with an old classmate who’s still harboring feelings for her…",
